","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:yang:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"瓊芝","kind":"person","person_id":"5mf_0mr_7v3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"j31","quote":"武元楊皇后諱艷，字瓊芝，弘農華陰人也。","raw_start":2857,"raw_end":2876,"raw_line":51},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao","book_id":"b-jinshu-031","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023","text":"後除太常卿，以疾不就。會遭母喪，歸鄉里。濤年逾耳順，居喪過禮，負土成墳，手植松柏。詔曰：「吾所共致化者，官人之職是也。方今風欲陵遲，人心進動，宜崇明好惡，鎮以退讓。山太常雖尚居諒闇，情在難奪，方今務殷，何得遂其志邪！其以濤為吏部尚書。」濤辭以喪病，章表懇切。會元皇后崩，遂扶興還洛。逼迫詔命，自力就職。前後選舉，周遍內外，而並得其才。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"w5t_irt_48t","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文親稱用於繫接未名母的喪事，排除於姓名別稱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"山太常","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0130","start":130,"end":133,"surface":"元皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"5mf_0mr_7v3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":23,"last_line":23,"raw_start":